WEBVTT

00:00:03.006 --> 00:00:04.653
<b>There’s</b> a garage.

00:00:04.851 --> 00:00:07.021
<b>There are</b> some pictures on the wall.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:10.840
<b>There isn’t</b> a swimming pool.

00:00:11.519 --> 00:00:13.461
<b>There aren’t</b> any plants in the room.

00:00:15.397 --> 00:00:17.835
<b>Is there</b> a bathroom downstairs?

00:00:18.174 --> 00:00:20.367
<b>Are there</b> any neighbors with children?

00:00:22.518 --> 00:00:24.029
Yes, <b>there is.</b>

00:00:24.374 --> 00:00:25.788
Yes, <b>there are.</b>

00:00:27.933 --> 00:00:29.439
No, <b>there isn’t.</b>

00:00:29.895 --> 00:00:31.406
No, <b>there aren’t.</b>